---
import CompliantLayout from '@/layouts/CompliantLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '@/components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<CompliantLayout title="Partner Disclosure" sectionAds="legal">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Transparency" title="Partner disclosure" description="How KitchenWise is funded — and what we will not do for money." />

  <section class="max-w-site mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-14">
    <article class="content-panel max-w-prose mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-ink">
      <p class="!mt-0">
        We don&rsquo;t use affiliate links. Some links go to shops run by the same team &mdash;
        they&rsquo;re labeled, so you always know when a link leads to something we run.
      </p>
      <p>
        When we point you to one of those shops (a phone case store, a children&rsquo;s storybook
        maker), it is labeled &ldquo;From our shop&rdquo; or &ldquo;From the team behind KitchenWise.&rdquo;
        We earn money only if you buy from a shop we run, and we never change what we say
        about kitchen gear because of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        We never accept payment to recommend a product, and we do not publish paid placements,
        sponsored posts or brand sponsorships. If you have questions about any specific
        recommendation, please reach out: <a href="mailto:hello@kitchenwise.app">hello@kitchenwise.app</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</CompliantLayout>
